sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Checkout flow
    accDescr: How a shopper pays for an order
    participant S as Shopper
    participant C as Checkout service
    participant P as Payment provider
    S->>C: Place the order with everything that is in the basket right now
    alt card accepted by the payment provider after the fraud checks
        C->>P: Charge the card for the full amount including delivery costs
        P-->>C: Payment confirmed with a reference for the receipt
    else card declined because of insufficient funds or a block
        P-->>C: Declined with a reason the shopper can understand
    end
    C-->>S: Show the result
